      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of cosmic insignificance, which can be incredibly heavy to carry. Many people grapple with these big questions about time and meaning when viewing the vastness of the universe. While the universe may be vast, the meaning we create in our own limited time is deeply real and valuable to us. Please consider reaching out to a therapist or a trusted person right now for support; you don't have to go through these overwhelming feelings alone.",
